# Components

1. Encapsulate component-only types/utils/constants inside the component folder
2. Create files only when needed
3. Nest subcomponents to mirror the UI tree

```txt
ComponentName/
  ComponentName.tsx
  ComponentName.test.ts
  utils/            # optional
  SubComponent/     # optional
```

Prefer named exports. Keep presentational UI separate from hooks/fetchers.
Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/COMPONENT_STRUCTURE.md`
